 "input": "how we arrange a funeral. family call, we collect the deceased (24/7 on-call team) and log them in the mortuary register. arrangement meeting with the family: date, burial or cremation, service details, all on the arrangement form. doctor's certificate and the registrar's green form needed before cremation paperwork goes to the crematorium. book the crematorium or cemetery and the celebrant around the family's date. hearse and limousines allocated from the fleet diary. order of service printed from the arrangement form. invoice the family; disbursements (crematorium fee, celebrant) paid by us first.",
